			<p>Analytic Geometry and Calculus I provides definitions and theorems that focus on limits and continuity, derivatives, and integration techniques. The course consists of a downloadable workbook with examples and practice problems broken into four chapters. This course supplements the Calculus OpenStax textbook found here: http://open-nj.sobeklibrary.com/AA00001328</p>

